/target/
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock IS committed: this workspace ships binaries (gt-mcp-server), so the lock
# must pin transitive versions for reproducible CI — without it CI re-resolves and can
# pull an incompatible newer transitive (e.g. pgvector → sqlx 0.9 vs the workspace 0.8).
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
node_modules/
.envrc.local
.claude/
# Graph artifacts — neutral umbrella (any tool) + graphify's concrete paths.
# Canonical set lives in gt-graphindex::artifacts::patterns_for (hq-graphrig.3/.11).
.graphindex/
.graphify-venv/
graphify-out/
.graphify_*
CLAUDE.md
